# 仓库里一律用 LF。Windows 上 core.autocrlf=true 会让 git 对每个"工作区是 LF"的文件
# 打印 `warning: ... LF will be replaced by CRLF the next time Git touches it`——
# 那些警告走 stderr，外层 PowerShell 会当成 NativeCommandError，进而把
# `node scripts/release.mjs` 的退出码变成 1（发布其实已经成功）。显式 eol=lf 后不再有该警告。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制别让 git 试图转换换行。
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
*.7z binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
